       },
       {
        "texto": "たべます か",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "do you eat?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The verb particles",
     "texto": [
      "**を** marks what receives the action (the object): **コーヒー を のみます** (I drink coffee). It is read «o».",
      "**へ** marks where you are going. As a particle it is read **e**: **かいしゃ へ いきます** (I go to the office). **に** can also be used.",
      "The usual order is: topic + time + place + object + verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
